<main class="look-col">
<h1 class="doc-title">hello-graph</h1>
<p class="description">Minimal example graph: implement, check, gate, and a router with two routes.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/acme/things" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"/></svg><span>Star on GitHub</span></a> <a class="button" href="/editor?from=acme%2Fthings%2Fflow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 7 8.7 2.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.4 0L2.7 5.3a2.41 2.41 0 0 0 0 3.4L7 13"/><path d="m8 6 2-2"/><path d="m18 16 2-2"/><path d="m17 11 4.3 4.3c.94.94.94 2.46 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6c-.94.94-2.46.94-3.4 0L11 17"/><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"/><path d="m15 5 4 4"/></svg><span>Edit a copy</span></a></p>
<aside class="community-warning" role="note"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg><p>Community document. UniverLab does not review it. Installing it lets canopy run <a href="#what-this-runs">the commands and agent instructions listed below</a> on your machine, with your permissions. Read them before you install.</p></aside>
