<figure class="plate"><svg class="plate-svg plate-h" viewBox="0 0 142.57 74.55" width="713" height="373" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>hello-graph</title><desc>Nodes in order: implementer, triage, tests, gate. Ensembles: reviewers.</desc><style>.plate-svg text{font-family:var(--font-mono,'Sometype Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace)}.plate-svg .edge{fill:none;stroke:var(--canopy,#00a9a0);stroke-width:.45;opacity:.85}.plate-svg .edge.fail{stroke:#ff6b6b;stroke-dasharray:1.4 1.1;opacity:.7}.plate-svg .edge.error{stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:.3;stroke-dasharray:.4 .8;opacity:.45}.plate-svg .edge.order{stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:.3;stroke-dasharray:.5 1.1;stroke-linecap:round;opacity:.9}.plate-svg .node .shape{fill:color-mix(in srgb, var(--nc, var(--canopy, #00a9a0)) 22%, #04110f);stroke:var(--nc, var(--canopy, #00a9a0));stroke-width:.45}.plate-svg .shape-chip .shape{fill:#0c1416;stroke:var(--ink-dim,#9a9890)}.plate-svg .shape-check .shape,.plate-svg .shape-gate .shape{fill:#0c1416;stroke:#e8f6f1}.plate-svg .shape-commit .shape{fill:color-mix(in srgb, var(--canopy, #00a9a0) 35%, #04110f);stroke:var(--canopy,#00a9a0)}.plate-svg .label{font-size:2.3px;fill:#e8f6f1}.plate-svg .harness{font-size:1.9px;fill:var(--nc, var(--canopy, #00a9a0));opacity:.9}.plate-svg .group-box{fill:none;stroke:var(--canopy,#00a9a0);stroke-width:.3;stroke-dasharray:1.2 .9;opacity:.8}.plate-svg .group-title,.plate-svg .group-subtitle{font-size:1.9px;fill:var(--canopy,#00a9a0);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.plate-svg .member-shape{fill:color-mix(in srgb, var(--nc, var(--canopy, #00a9a0)) 22%, #04110f);stroke:var(--nc, var(--canopy, #00a9a0));stroke-width:.3}.plate-svg .member-label{font-size:1.9px;fill:#e8f6f1;text-anchor:middle}.plate-svg .token{fill:var(--canopy,#00a9a0)}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.plate-svg .token{display:none}}</style><g class="edges"><path class="edge error" d="M17.59 18 C43.59 18 43.59 57 69.59 57" data-from="implem