<dl class="sheet"><div class="field"><dt>Kind</dt><dd><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="8" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><rect width="8" height="8" x="13" y="13" rx="2"/></svg> graph</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Name</dt><dd>hello-graph</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Source</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/acme/things" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">acme/things<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg></a></dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Ref</dt><dd>main</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Stars</dt><dd><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"/></svg> 2 stars</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Nodes</dt><dd>agent 1 · router 1 · check 1 · gate 1</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Edges</dt><dd>8 edges · 1 fail</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Ensembles</dt><dd>reviewers (parallel, 2 members)</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Agent nodes</dt><dd>implementer</dd></div><div class="field"><dt>Install</dt><dd><span class="row-install"><code>canopy graph install acme/things/