<div class="readme"><h1>hello-graph</h1>
<p>A graph the page tests render, with <strong>one fail edge</strong>.</p>
<h2>Install</h2>
<pre><code>canopy graph install hello-graph</code></pre>
<p>Read the <a href="https://univerlab.org/canopy/" rel="nofollow">docs</a> and run <code>npm test</code>.</p></div>
